vscode-insiders-updater (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Show installed and latest Insiders commit hashes in GUI and CLI.
  * Move install workflow off the GUI thread to prevent app freezing
    during download and installation.
  * Bump application and package version to 0.1.2.

