vscode-insiders-updater (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix Insiders update detection when product version is unchanged by
    using build metadata.
  * Report update check failures explicitly instead of showing up-to-date.
  * Improve CLI diagnostics for update source and network/API errors.
  * Relax hard PySide6 package dependency for wider distro compatibility.
  * Bump application and package version to 0.1.1.

